## 4. 🗄️ BASE DE DATOS

Tablas: `bookmarks`, `collections`, `bookmark_collections`, `tags`,
`bookmark_tags`, `highlights`, `reminders`, `activity_log`, `auto_rules`,
`notes`, `ai_assistants`, `user_preferences`.

SQL clave (día 2):

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS user_preferences (
  user_id uuid PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  sidebar_order jsonb,
  updated_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now()
);
ALTER TABLE user_preferences ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
-- Políticas: SELECT / INSERT / UPDATE con auth.uid() = user_id
```

SQL clave (día 1): tabla `ai_assistants` + políticas; `notes.deleted`;
contraseña con `crypt('Bookmark2024!', gen_salt('bf'))`
(`confirmed_at` NO se toca: es columna generada).

